This is not a successful end-to-end lab result. The VM was registered, Azure File Sync agent 23.2.0.0 was installed, FileSyncSvc was running, managed identity was active, F:\AfsLab was prepared, and connectivity diagnostics found zero issues. However, cloud-endpoint provisioning was canceled before any server endpoint or throttling test was created.

The final delete-and-recreate attempt failed again with the same backend authorization condition. The terminal recommendation was to escalate with correlation ID 42ec139a-1a25-46ee-8b20-664bc81c2a4f for the failure at 2026-11-12 06:36 UTC.

